Firstly, given our experience with GDPR and having a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, we ensure that all data processing activities comply with GDPR principles. Our standard data residency policy is set to "EU only," ensuring that all client data is hosted exclusively within the European Union. Furthermore, our cross-border transfer policy prohibits any transfer of data outside the EU unless there's an explicit legal basis for doing so, aligning with GDPR requirements for international data transfers.

