For audit and compliance purposes, we have in place comprehensive logging capabilities where all queries are logged with an immutable method using append-only logs with SHA-256 hash chaining. This ensures the integrity of our audit trails, which are retained for 7 years. Additionally, our real-time SIEM integration enables prompt detection and response to security incidents.

Given our certification to ISO 27001, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, we have a robust Information Security Management System (ISMS) in place. This framework ensures that all aspects of information security are addressed, from risk management and asset control to access management and incident response, thereby supporting our compliance with GDPR and other regulatory requirements.

Our experience with various EU regulatory frameworks such as the EU AI Act, RGS v2, SecNumCloud, and NIS2 Directive will also be leveraged to ensure that our solution complies with the latest legal and technical standards applicable in the European Union. This includes ensuring high availability, secure data hosting, and adherence to specific industry standards where required.

In terms of incident response, we have a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) in place, along with established playbooks for handling different types of incidents, including data breaches. Our breach notification policy ensures timely communication with affected parties within the required 72-hour window.

To comply with the client's requirements for explainability and transparency, we will ensure that our solution provides clear explanations for the recommendations or proposals it issues. This includes being able to trace back how certain decisions were made, which is facilitated by our audit logging capabilities and transparent AI model operations.

Finally, our commitment to environmental sustainability, as reflected in our experience with reducing energetic consumption and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact, will be integrated into the deployment and operation of the solution, ensuring that it not only meets but exceeds the client's expectations for a responsible and compliant technology partner.
